    'Pot all reds or yellows in your group, then pot the black on a separate legal shot. Potting it early or on a foul loses the frame.': '打完红球组或黄球组后，再用单独一次合法击球打进黑球。过早或犯规时打进黑球会输掉该局。',
    'A frame is won by legally potting the black after clearing your group; matches count frames won.': '清完本组后合法打进黑球即赢下一局；比赛按获胜局数计分。',
    'Libre uses three balls: two cue balls and one red object ball, placed on the marked starting positions.': 'Libre使用三颗球：两颗主球和一颗红色目标球，放在标记的开球位置。',
    'No point is scored unless the cue ball contacts both other balls. A ball leaving the table is penalized under FFB rules.': '主球必须碰到另外两颗球才能得分；球离开台面按法国台球联合会规则处罚。',
    'Score caroms to reach the agreed target; the turn passes after a missed carom.': '连续完成碰球得分达到约定目标；漏球后换对手击球。',
